spans.s:
नि-√ मज्ज् P. Ā. -मज्जति, ˚ते (p. -मज्जत् and ˚ज्जमान, MBh.; pf. -ममज्ज, MārkP.; fut. -मज्जिष्यति, MBh.; -मङ्क्ष्ये, AitBr.; aor. -अमाङ्क्षीत्, Bhaṭṭ.; -मज्जीः, MBh.),
to sink down, dive, sink or plunge or penetrate into, bathe in (loc.), Br.; Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to sink in its cavity (the eye), Suśr.;
to disappear, perish, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to immerse or submerge in water, cause to sink or perish, MBh. :
Caus. -मज्जयति, to cause to dive under water, Mn. viii, 114;
 (with समरे, संग्रामे &c.) to cause to penetrate into a battle, lead into the thick of a fight, MBh.

नि-√ मिष् P. -मिषति (aor. -अमीमिषत्), to shut the eyelids, wink, fall asleep, RV. &c. &c.;
to be shut (said of the eyelids), R.;
 (fut. -मिष्यति ?), Daś. (cf. अ-निमिषत्).

नि-√ मील् P. -मीलति, to shut the eyes, fall asleep;
to close (as flowers), die, disappear, Mn.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 Caus. -मीलयति (˚ते), to close (the eyes, eyelids, blossoms &c.), MBh.; Kāv. &c. (cf. नि-मीलित below).

नि-√ मृज् P. Ā. -मार्ष्टि, -मृष्टे, -मृजति, ˚ते &c. (Pot. -मृज्यात्, Mn.; -मृञ्ज्यात्, ŚBr.; Impv. -मृढ्वम्, TS.; pf. -मामृजुर्, ˚जे, RV. [for मिमृक्षुर्, RV. i, 64, 4 read मिमिक्षुर् and See under नि-म्यक्ष्]; aor. -अमृक्षाम, ib.; -अमृष्ट, ŚBr.),
to rub in or upon (loc.), wipe off;
 Ā. to cleanse one's self, TS.; ŚBr.; Śr. & GṛS.; Mn. &c.;
to lead or bring or attach to (loc.);
 Ā. to take to one's self, appropriate, RV.

नि-√ म्यक्ष् P. -म्यक्षति (pf. 3. du. -मिमिक्षतुर्; 3. pl. -मिमिक्षुर् Ā. ˚क्षिरे),
to hold, wield (thunderbolt &c.), RV. vii, 20, 4; viii, 50, 5;
 (Ā.) to be contained or present in (loc.), x, 96, 5;
to be fixed on (loc.), i, 64, 4 (read मिमिक्षुर् for मिमृक्षुर्).
